    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moran Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptional 4-bedroom detached residence, newly arrived to the Market located in a quiet and peaceful setting of Castlebar this home offers a perfect blend of tranquillity and modern convenience. The property is only a short walk to Town Centre, which provides all essential services, including Schools (both National and Secondary) University Hospital, Atu. and a wide range of social amenities. Despite its proximity to these conveniences, the home remains a peaceful retreat for those seeking a quiet and relaxing lifestyle. Located in a quiet and peaceful setting of castlebar just minutes from the picturesque greenway.\r\nThis home offers a perfect blend of tranquillity and modern convenience. this prime location is ideal for walking enthusiasts, offering endless opportunities to enjoy the beautiful surroundings and relaxed lifestyle.\r\nPresented in excellent decorative condition, the residence boasts a detached Garage, wonderfully manicured paved ground to the front and rear, and ample parking space.this home is perfectly suited for modern Family living and offers an exceptional lifestyle. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this beautiful property has to offer"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation comprises:-\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: With stone tiled floor.\r\nSeparate toilet & whb. With white suite , mosaic stone tiling to floor\r\nSitting Room:( 14`2”x 16`3”) With solid fuel stove heats room only. Solid Oak flooring.\r\nKitchen/ Dining Area: (26`4”x 14`6”) Ceramic floor tiles to include solid oak units with double fridgefreezer( American Style),Neff Appliances to include hob and oven, microwave, integrated dishwasher, ironing board facility. Patio door to paved south facing court yard.\r\nSpacious Landing.\r\nBedroom(1): ( 11`x 10`5”) With cream built in units, maple flooring.\r\nBedroom(2): ( 10`5”x 10`5”) With built in units.\r\nEnsuite: With electric shower , white suite and tiled flooring. Glass shelving.\r\nHot-press.\r\nBathroom: (15`x 9`7”) With feature cream built in units. White suite with built in sink and vanity unit.\r\nBedroom(3): ( 13`8”x 10`) With cream built in units.\r\nEnsuite: With electric shower and tiled walls and floor.\r\nBedroom(4): (12`7”x 9`5”) With cream units.\r\n\r\nDetached Garage ( 15`5”x 16`6”) plumbed for washing machine/ dryer.\r\n• Oil fired central heating.\r\n• Pvc double glazed windows throughout.\r\n• Paved area to front and rear.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Moran Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Moran Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Moran Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
